## 🎯 UI Controls

### Tour Panel (Left Side)
- **Width:** 320px (narrower than before)
- **Position:** Left side of screen
- **Minimize:** Click `-` button or press `T` / `Esc`
- **Close:** Click `×` button (hides until restart)
- **Expand:** Click the collapsed tab or press `T`

### Control Buttons (Bottom Right)
- **Tour Button:** Appears when tour is closed, click to restart
- **Reset Button:** Always visible, reloads the demo

