## 📋 Modal Stacking Order (v6.5)

All modals now stack properly with progressive z-indexes:

| Layer | Z-Index | Modals | Opens From |
|-------|---------|--------|------------|
| Base | `z-50` | Credential Detail, Request Credentials, Request Missing Info | Main UI |
| Nested | `z-[60]` | View Proof, Document Preview | Credential Detail modal |
| Cost | `z-[70]` | Cost Confirmation | Credential Detail modal |
| System | `z-[80]` | Credits Panel | Header |
| Tour | `z-[1002]` | Tour panel | System |
| Welcome | `z-[2000]` | Welcome modal | System |
| Version | `z-[2001]` | Version information | System |

**Result:** The most recently opened modal always appears in the foreground.

